<title>USA: Data Research Associates Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Data Research Associates Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Quarterly Results (in thousands, except per-share data)</p>
<p>Three Months Ended Sept. 30  Fiscal Year Ended Sept. 30</p>
<p>				   (unaudited)	   (audited)</p>
<p>			   1996	1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p>Revenues:</p>
<p> Hardware	    $2,699    $2,425	$11,724	$10,905</p>
<p> Software	     3,722     2,412	  9,949	  8,513</p>
<p>Services and other</p>
<p>			  4,350     3,812	 16,909	 15,449</p>
<p> Total revenues    10,771     8,649	 38,582	 34,867</p>
<p> Net income	   1,716     1,535	  4,454	  3,634</p>
<p> Earnings per share   .31	 .28	    .81	    .66</p>
<p>Weighted average number</p>
<p>  of common shares  5,495     5,494	  5,482	  5,494</p>
<p>NOTE: All EPS data adjusted for three-for-two stock split issued as a 50 percent stock dividend in August, 1996.</p>
<p>Full name is Data Research Associates Inc.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
